{
  "name": "A fee takes an account below zero; it cannot spend until funded, and a void returns the fee",
  "rules": ["E-3.3", "E-9.3", "E-10.11", "E-15.4", "E-15.5", "E-15.6"],
  "notes": [
    "The default schedule is maker 0, taker 70 000 (7%). A has 10000c; B has exactly 500c.",
    "Step 2: B sells 10 at 50c from flat. Its reservation, noCost = 500, is all its cash and passes check 18: fees are not reserved (D-26).",
    "The fill costs B 500 and the taker fee ceil(70000 * 500 * 500 / 10^9) = ceil(17.5) = 18, leaving B at -18. Account 0: 18. A: 10000 - 500 = 9500.",
    "E-3.3 allows it: B's available cash, -18, is not below min(0, 500) - 18 = -18.",
    "Step 3: B offers 1 at 99c from its short: noCost(98, 1) = 1 is compared with max(0, -18) = 0 and rejected INSUFFICIENT_SLEEVE.",
    "Step 4: VOID. eventCash: A -500; B -500 - 18 = -518; account 0 +18. Payouts, ascending by account: 0 pays back -18, A receives 500, B 518. Sum 1000 = collateral (E-15.6): the fee moved cash between B and account 0, never collateral (D-28).",
    "Everyone ends where they started: account 0 at 0, A at 10000, B at 500."
  ],
  "setup": [
    {"op": "centTable", "tickTableId": 1},
    {"op": "binary", "eventId": 100, "instrumentId": 1000},
    {"op": "fund", "accountId": 1, "cents": 10000},
    {"op": "fund", "accountId": 2, "cents": 500},
    {"msg": "SetFeeSchedule", "makerRateMicros": 0, "takerRateMicros": 70000}
  ],
  "steps": [
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O1", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9500, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "orderCount": 1}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O2", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b1", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 500},
       {"msg": "Fill", "tradeId": "T1", "instrumentId": 1000, "tick": 49, "quantity": 10, "makerOrderId": "O1", "makerAccountId": 1, "makerRemaining": 0, "takerOrderId": "O2", "takerAccountId": 2, "takerRemaining": 0, "takerSide": "SELL", "mintedPairs": 10, "burnedPairs": 0, "buyerCashCents": -500, "sellerCashCents": -500, "makerFeeCents": 0, "takerFeeCents": 18},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": 10},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 2, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": -10},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 0, "availableCents": 18, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9500, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 2, "availableCents": -18, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 49, "quantity": 0, "orderCount": 0}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b2", "instrumentId": 1000, "side": "SELL", "tick": 98, "quantity": 1},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderRejected", "accountId": 2, "clientOrderId": "b2", "instrumentId": 1000, "reason": "INSUFFICIENT_SLEEVE"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "ResolveEvent", "commandId": "v1", "eventId": 100, "kind": "VOID", "caseId": 1, "voidWeights": []},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "v1", "outcome": "APPLIED"},
       {"msg": "MarketStateChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "state": "VOIDED"},
       {"msg": "SettlementPayout", "accountId": 0, "instrumentId": 0, "kind": "VOID", "positionClosed": 0, "cents": -18},
       {"msg": "SettlementPayout", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 0, "kind": "VOID", "positionClosed": 0, "cents": 500},
       {"msg": "SettlementPayout", "accountId": 2, "instrumentId": 0, "kind": "VOID", "positionClosed": 0, "cents": 518},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": 0},
       {"msg": "PositionChanged", "accountId": 2, "instrumentId": 1000, "position": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 0, "availableCents": 0, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 10000, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 2, "availableCents": 500, "reservedCents": 0}
     ]}
  ]
}
